		title: "AI Blog Thumbnail & Visual Asset Generator",
		subtitle: "Automated Flux/Together AI image synthesis and vector typography compositor",
		stack: ["TypeScript", "Node.js", "Express", "Together AI (Flux)", "Sharp / Canvas", "REST API"],
		bullets: [
			"Built an automated visual pipeline that transforms article titles and summaries into context-aware visual prompts and generates high-resolution artwork via Flux diffusion models.",
